## Payments – Stripe Only

- **Primary endpoints**:
  - `/payments/purchase` in [routes/payments.py](mdc:routes/payments.py)
  - Stripe-specific routes in [routes/payments/stripe.py](mdc:routes/payments/stripe.py) (e.g., `/stripe/obtain-plan`, `/stripe/webhook`, confirmations and seat/client ops)

- **Client/Adapter**:
  - Stripe client: [integrations/payments/stripe/client.py](mdc:integrations/payments/stripe/client.py)
  - Adapter: [services/payments/stripe_adapter.py](mdc:services/payments/stripe_adapter.py)

- **Environment**:
  - `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`, `STRIPE_PUBLIC_KEY`, `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`, `FRONTEND_URL`

- **Docs**:
  - Overview: [docs/PAYMENT_SYSTEM_STRIPE_ONLY.md](mdc:docs/PAYMENT_SYSTEM_STRIPE_ONLY.md)
  - Endpoint details: [routes/payments/stripe.md](mdc:routes/payments/stripe.md)

- **Permissions**: protect purchase/upgrade/seat endpoints using the permissions decorators (see Permissions rule).

